# 🕊️ Skoruba.AuditLogging
> Simple audit logging for .NET Core with EntityFramework Core support

**This project is ported to .NET 10.** 🚀

# How to install

```ps
dotnet add package Skoruba.AuditLogging.EntityFramework --version 3.0.0
```

